// Syncthing ignore rules — copy this file to C:\CryptoNite-MT5-Bots\.stignore
// (one level above the bot folders, at the root of the shared folder)
// These files will NOT sync to any machine.

// ── CRITICAL: Telegram session files (machine-specific login — NEVER share) ──
**/*.session
**/*.session-journal

// ── Python cache (auto-generated per machine) ──
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd

// ── Syncthing conflict copies (review manually if they appear) ──
**/*.sync-conflict-*

// ── Editor / OS junk ──
**/*.tmp
**/*.bak
**/*~
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
